        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#193d66,#112840);color:white;font-family:system-ui\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.2;background-image:linear-gradient(#acc6eb 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#acc6eb 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:8cqw 8cqw\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:4cqw;border-top:.4cqw solid #f5c542;padding-top:2cqw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font:900 2.2cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#f5c542\">KEEP / A WORKING EXAMPLE</b><span style=\"font:800 1.6cqw system-ui;color:#c1d1e9\">ILLUSTRATIVE · EDITABLE</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:13cqw;font:500 9cqw/1.04 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em\">The plan is still here.</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:26cqw;font:400 2.8cqw system-ui;color:#e0e9fb\">An AI helped make it. The conversation ended. The work didn't.</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:40cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2cqw\"><div style=\"height:27cqw;border:1px solid #9e8bc4;background:#66518c35;border-radius:2cqw;padding:2cqw;font:900 2.4cqw system-ui;color:#f5c542\">YESTERDAY<div style=\"font:400 1.8cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#e7e7f8;margin-top:1cqw\">A conversation begins it</div></div><div style=\"height:27cqw;border:1px solid #9ebcdb;background:#29557a45;border-radius:2cqw;padding:2cqw;font:900 2.4cqw system-ui;color:#f5c542\">TODAY<div style=\"font:400 1.8cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#e7e7f8;margin-top:1cqw\">The graph keeps it</div></div><div style=\"height:27cqw;border:1px solid #91bfb7;background:#1d665b45;border-radius:2cqw;padding:2cqw;font:900 2.4cqw system-ui;color:#f5c542\">TOMORROW<div style=\"font:400 1.8cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#e7e7f8;margin-top:1cqw\">A new session can continue</div></div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:89cqw;padding-top:2cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2cqw;align-items:start;font:900 1.9cqw/1.3 system-ui;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#dce8fa;text-align:center\"><span>THE WORK IS EDITABLE</span><span>THE RELATIONSHIPS<br>ARE REAL</span><span>THE FILE IS PORTABLE</span></div></div>"
