        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#172c49;color:#f7f9ff;border:2px solid #7795c0;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(20px,4cqw,38px);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif\"><div style=\"font:900 12px/1.3 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#f5c542\">01 / YESTERDAY</div><h2 style=\"font:600 clamp(26px,4.5cqw,37px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;margin:15px 0 20px\">A conversation begins it</h2><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #a98ce3;padding:9px 0 9px 17px;margin-bottom:15px;background:#263a5d\"><div style=\"font:900 12px system-ui;color:#e2d3ff;letter-spacing:.08em\">PERSON</div><p style=\"font:400 clamp(15px,2.4cqw,19px)/1.6 system-ui;color:#e7efff;margin:10px 0\">Help me plan a neighborhood movie night. We need somewhere to show the film, a projector, and a way to invite people.</p></div><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #f5c542;padding:9px 0 9px 17px;background:#263a5d\"><div style=\"font:900 12px system-ui;color:#f5c542;letter-spacing:.08em\">AI</div><p style=\"font:400 clamp(15px,2.4cqw,19px)/1.6 system-ui;color:#e7efff;margin:10px 0\">I'll organize that as a goal, two tasks, and an open question about the weather.</p></div><p style=\"font:500 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#bcd3f0;margin-top:22px\">Illustrative conversation. The actual saved nodes are in this graph.</p></div>"
