        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#172c49;color:#f7f9ff;border:2px solid #7795c0;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(20px,4cqw,38px);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif\"><div style=\"font:900 12px/1.3 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#f5c542\">03 / TOMORROW</div><h2 style=\"font:600 clamp(26px,4.5cqw,37px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffffff;margin:15px 0 20px\">Continue with another AI</h2><p style=\"font:400 clamp(15px,2.4cqw,19px)/1.6 system-ui;color:#e7efff;margin:10px 0\">The conversation is over. <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">The graph isn't.</strong></p><p style=\"font:400 clamp(15px,2.4cqw,19px)/1.6 system-ui;color:#e7efff;margin:10px 0\">Give a compatible AI access to this saved graph and ask:</p><div style=\"background:#293e61;border:1px solid #8fb5df;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;font:500 clamp(15px,2.2cqw,18px)/1.56 system-ui;color:#ffffff\">“Read this graph as the saved plan for a neighborhood movie night. Identify unresolved questions and propose the next useful action. Do not modify the graph without asking my permission.”</div><p style=\"font:400 clamp(15px,2.4cqw,19px)/1.6 system-ui;color:#e7efff;margin:10px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#f5c542\">Check:</strong> Is the goal intact? Are the tasks related? Is the weather question still open?</p><p style=\"font:500 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#bcd3f0\">This prompt does not automatically invoke an AI. It is a real handoff you can test.</p></div>"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1794975092744,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
